\title{[DP3] Consulting algorithm (1 pt)}
\date{2026-10-27T21:43:04Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\tag{problem}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Describe an efficient algorithm that takes values for #{n}, #{M}, and sequences of operating costs #{N_1, \dots, N_n} and #{S_1, \dots, S_n}, and returns the \em{cost} of an optimal plan. Justify the correctness of your algorithm and analyze its asymptotic running time.}

